steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/689acc2e913c5f386f48c031eebddaf7.webm?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/689acc2e913c5f386f48c031eebddaf7.mp4?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard science fiction inspired by Lem, Heinlein, Egan, the Strugatsky brothers, and other classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted visuals, impressionism + noir, digital oil paints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love story set against the vastness of space and existential questions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operatic vocals, strings, saxophone, and warm analog synths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No choices, one powerful ending. Pure storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a real scientist working in a research lab.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/dc6eade85cd1c0fdbe2b148c7ff80b42.poster.avif?t=1764452082\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/dc6eade85cd1c0fdbe2b148c7ff80b42.webm?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/dc6eade85cd1c0fdbe2b148c7ff80b42.mp4?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mayak is a visual novel with 2D adventure elements \u2014 intimate and atmospheric. Expect interactive scenes, exploration, and scientific insights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Science!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated explanations of scientific concepts, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstellar travel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life cycles of stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal transmission and decoding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/b054614761417a0fe843e0b2477cccc1.poster.avif?t=1764452082\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/b054614761417a0fe843e0b2477cccc1.webm?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/b054614761417a0fe843e0b2477cccc1.mp4?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >She</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space isn\u2019t so cold when someone you love is there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/a5f07406a6541259cd22b343edac3a66.poster.avif?t=1764452082\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/a5f07406a6541259cd22b343edac3a66.webm?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/extras/a5f07406a6541259cd22b343edac3a66.mp4?t=1764452082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Nikita Nplus1"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910330/3fa782d86965b8f02e72c4aae0bd0f845c55a5f8/header.jpg?t=1764452082","is_free":false,"linux_req